          ↥(modularLocalizedAtPoint (1 * q) (coeffSubring A K) (redRestrict red K) a (a ^ q)))} ∧
      ∀ c : ↥(coeffSubring A K), (⟨modularEval (1 * q) (coeffSubring A K) (MvPolynomial.X 0 - MvPolynomial.C c),
