          modularEval_mem_modularLocalizedAtPoint (1 * q) (coeffSubring A K) (redRestrict red K) a (a ^ q) _⟩ :
          ↥(modularLocalizedAtPoint (1 * q) (coeffSubring A K) (redRestrict red K) a (a ^ q))),
